From: ae-automation-bot <ae-automation-bot@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 28 Oct 2026 14:38:41 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 230/260] [ae-patch] Ask whether a Claude login switch should
 move the chat's child chats too

A chat with child chats now opens a "Switch the child chats too?" dialog when its
Claude login is switched from the action dock or the composer's Account menu.
"Parent and children" (the default) sends include_children to the switch route;
"Parent only" sends the plain body. The toast lists moved, slow and skipped
children. A chat with no children switches at once as before.
